TITLE
Lichtner's 2D copper leaching problem
END

DATABASE
copper.dbs
END

RUNTIME
time_units          years
timestep_max        0.0001
timestep_init       0.0000001
corrmax             2.0
time_tolerance      0.001
debye-huckel        true
database_sweep      false
speciate_only       false
lag_activity        false
gimrt               true
graphics            tecplot
master_variable     H+
hindmarsh           false
solver              direct
PC                  ilu
PClevel             10
GIMRT_PC            bjacobi
GIMRT_PClevel       0
GIMRT_solver        gmres
screen_output       50
ResidualTolerance   1.0E-08
END

OUTPUT
time_units               years
spatial_profile_at_time  0.50 1.0  1.57 2.0 
time_series_at_node      copperleach.out  5 1
time_series_print        Cu++ pH
time_series_interval     1  
END

POROSITY
fix_porosity     0.05
porosity_update  false
END

TEMPERATURE
set_temperature  25.0
END

DISCRETIZATION 
xzones  20   0.5
END
 
Condition initial_condition Initial condition for simulation 
temperature      25.0
porosity         0.05
Na+              0.01
K+               1.0E-06
Ca++             6.8513E-04
pH               3.5
Cu++             1.0E-06
Al+++            Kaolinite           
Fe+++             1.d-15
SiO2(aq)         1.8703E-04
HCO3-            CO2(g)    0.001    
SO4--            5.0e-04   
Cl-              0.01   
O2(aq)           O2(g)     0.20
H2O              55.50843506
Chrysocolla      0.005  100.0
Goethite         0.025  100.0
Kaolinite        0.05   100.0
Muscovite        0.05   100.0
Quartz           0.82   100.0
SiO2(am)         0.0    100.0
Gypsum           0.0    100.0
Jarosite         0.0    100.0
Jurbanite        0.0    100.0
Alunite          0.0    100.0
END

Condition leach_solution    Composition of leach solution at injection well
temperature     25.0
set_porosity    0.05
Na+             0.01  
K+              1.d-06
Ca++            1.d-06
pH              1.0    
Cu++            1.0e-10  
Al+++           1.0-08
Fe+++           1.d-10
SiO2(aq)        1.d-06
HCO3-           CO2(g)    0.01 
SO4--           1.0e-05  
Cl-             0.01     
O2(aq)          O2(g)     0.20
H2O             55.50843506
Chrysocolla     0.005  100.0
Goethite        0.025  100.0
Kaolinite       0.05   100.0
Muscovite       0.05   100.0
Quartz          0.82   100.0
SiO2(am)        0.0    100.0
Gypsum          0.0    100.0
Jarosite        0.0    100.0
Jurbanite       0.0    100.0
Alunite         0.0    100.0
END

INITIAL_CONDITIONS
initial_condition  1-20  1-1   1-1 
END

BOUNDARY_CONDITIONS
X_begin   initial_condition     Flux 
X_end     initial_condition  Flux 

END

TRANSPORT
time_units  years
distance_units  meters
diffusion     1.0d-09
dispersivity  0.0  0.0
END

FLOW
time_units          years
distance_units      meters
calculate_flow      false
constant_flow       1.0
END

!!FLOW
!!time_units  years
!!read_velocity copper
!!pump    0.00525   leach_solution     1  1  1
!!pump   -0.00525   leach_solution    30  30  1
!!END

PRIMARY_SPECIES
H2O
Na+
K+
Ca++
H+
Cu++
Al+++
Fe+++
SiO2(aq)
HCO3-
SO4--
Cl-
O2(aq)
END

SECONDARY_SPECIES
Al(OH)2+
!!! Al(SO4)2-
!!! AlO2-
AlOH++
!!! AlSO4+
CO2(aq)
CO3--
CaCO3(aq)
CaHCO3+
CaOH+
CaSO4(aq)
CuCl+
CuCl2(aq)
CuCl3--
CuCl4--
CuO2--
CuOH+
CuSO4(aq)
!CaCl+
!CaCl2(aq)
!FeCl+
!FeCl2(aq)
!FeCl4--
!FeOH+
Fe(OH)2(aq)
Fe(OH)2+
Fe(OH)3(aq)
Fe(OH)3-
Fe(OH)4-
!Fe(OH)4--
FeSO4(aq)
FeSO4+
Fe(SO4)2-
H2SiO4--
HAlO2(aq)
HSO4-
OH-
Cu+
Fe++
END

MINERALS
Chrysocolla -label default -rate  -6.00  
Goethite   -label default  -rate  -7.00 
Kaolinite  -label default  -rate  -19.00 
Muscovite  -label default  -rate  -19.00
Quartz     -label default  -rate  -10.00
SiO2(am)   -label default  -rate  -7.00
Gypsum     -label default  -rate  -6.00
Jarosite   -label default  -rate  -7.00
Jurbanite  -label default  -rate  -7.00 
Alunite    -label default  -rate  -7.00 
END

GASES
O2(g)
CO2(g)
END

permeability_X      1.5e-13  
permeability_X      1.5e-13    zone  0-0    1-1  1-1
permeability_X      1.5e-13    zone  6-6  1-1  1-1
pressure            1.0      default 
pressure            10.0  zone  0-0  1-1  1-1 fix
pressure            0.0   zone  6-6  1-1  1-1 fix
!!! pumpunits   liter_sec
!!! pump     0.68     leach_solution     1  1   1
!!! pump    -0.68     leach_solution    5  1  1
